don't let a deadline rush you.

319
00:16:51,719 --> 00:16:56,069
So, did GWM just undercut
the Toyota RAV4 in Australia?

320
00:16:56,119 --> 00:17:01,225
On price, power and electric range
yes, on paper, by a long way.

321
00:17:01,275 --> 00:17:07,722
A $49,990 drive-away plug-in
hybrid with 320 kilowatts and

322
