00:17:14,799 --> 00:17:19,469
reputation and dealer network and a
cheaper RAV4 plug-in hybrid is coming in

325
00:17:19,519 --> 00:17:21,129
early 2027.

326
00:17:21,179 --> 00:17:23,509
The real winner is you, the buyer.

327
00:17:23,559 --> 00:17:26,129
More competition means better
cars and sharper prices.

